# FinanceGuard environment variables
#
# Cloud sync is OPTIONAL. Leave everything blank to run FinanceGuard 100% locally
# — the app works with no account and nothing breaks if this file is missing.
#
# To enable zero-knowledge cloud sync:
#   1. Create a free Supabase project (https://supabase.com).
#   2. Run the SQL migrations in supabase/migrations/ (0001_vault.sql, 0002_active_session.sql).
#   3. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values below.
#   4. Restart the dev server / rebuild (these are compiled into the client at build time).
#
# The anon key is public by design: security comes from client-side encryption
# (AES-256-GCM) + Supabase Row Level Security, never from keeping this key secret.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Desktop (Electron) only, optional ---------------------------------------
# Override where the encrypted bundle and per-device state are stored.
# FG_DATA_DIR=
# FG_LOCAL_DIR=
